    "answer": "to{} refuse/reject/dismiss/turn-down/decline | inform/give-notice/tell-in-advance | ask-leave/excuse-oneself-(from)",
    "mnemonic": "Because the hiragana ends with an <ja>う</ja> sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means <kanji>cut off</kanji>. What happens when you do the action of cutting someone off? You're going <vocabulary>to refuse</vocabulary> them whatever it is they want.",
